        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: The Majors\n- Places: Philadelphia, Pennsylvania\n- Concepts: American R&B, doo-wop\n- Topics: vocal harmony, pop-oriented R&B styles, nonsense syllables, simple beat, instrumentation, simple music and lyrics\n\nFacts:\n- The Majors were an American R&B and doo-wop group from Philadelphia, Pennsylvania.\n- Doo-wop was built on vocal harmony and was one of the most mainstream, pop-oriented R&B styles of its time.\n- Doo-wop features vocal group harmony, nonsense syllables, a simple beat, sometimes little or no instrumentation, and simple music and lyrics.",
